speechtext:
1.	What are the educational standards at present required for enlistment in the (a) navy; (b) army;
(c)	air force?
2.	On what date were these educational requirements put into effect?

1.	As a number of transfers and subdivisions have been carried out without formal record being made at the registry offices it is not possible at this time to say how many properties belonging to individuals will be affected. The searching of titles to establish ownership is continuing.
TMr. Campney.]
2.	As of February 1, approximately 125 letters containing offers of settlement have been sent to occupants.
3.	In considering the amount of settlement, the following are taken into account:
(a)	the appraised value of the land;
(b)	the appraised value of timber;
(c)	the appraised value of buildings;
(d)	compensation for disturbance, where applicable.
